What is the output of the following Java program contrasting static field and instance field access via a null reference?
```java
class Device {
    public static int counter = 100;
    public int code = 200;
}
public class DeviceAccessApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Device dev = null;
        int a = dev.counter;
        System.out.print(a + " ");
        try {
            int b = dev.code;
            System.out.print(b);
        } catch (NullPointerException e) {
            System.out.print("NPE");
        }
    }
}
```

